{"seq":1,"slug":"json-rpc-transport","title":"JSON-RPC 传输层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/json-rpc-transport","wordCount":1112,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"json-rpc-传输层\">JSON-RPC 传输层</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LSP 的传输层可以拆成三个正交的关注点：<strong>消息语义</strong>（JSON-RPC 2.0 定义的请求、响应、通知三类消息）、<strong>消息分帧</strong>（用 <code>Content-Length</code> 头把连续字节流切成一条条完整消息）、<strong>传输通道</strong>（stdin/stdout、TCP、WebSocket 等底层管道）。三者相互独立——同一套 JSON-RPC 语义可以跑在任意通道上，分帧则是通道之上的统一约定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>关键约定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息语义</td>\n<td>一次调用长什么样、谁回应谁</td>\n<td>请求有 <code>id</code>，通知无 <code>id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息分帧</td>\n<td>从连续字节流中切出单条消息</td>\n<td><code>Content-Length</code> 计 UTF-8 字节数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输通道</td>\n<td>消息经由什么管道传递</td>\n<td>不绑定具体传输，按场景选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解这层的关键在于：LSP 并不发明新的消息格式，而是复用 JSON-RPC 2.0，只在其上补了一层分帧约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"json-rpc-2-0-基础\">JSON-RPC 2.0 基础</h2><p>LSP 构建在 JSON-RPC 2.0 协议之上。JSON-RPC 定义了一种无状态、轻量级的远程过程调用协议，使用 JSON 作为数据编码格式。在 LSP 中，每条消息都是一个 JSON-RPC 请求、响应或通知。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RequestMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  id: number | string;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: object | unknown[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ResponseMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  id: number | string | null;&#10;  result?: unknown;&#10;  error?: ResponseError;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NotificationMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: object | unknown[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三种消息类型的核心区别在于 <code>id</code> 字段的存在与否：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th><code>id</code> 字段</th>\n<th>是否需要响应</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求</td>\n<td>必须存在</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>completion、hover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应</td>\n<td>对应请求</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>请求的返回结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知</td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>didChange、didSave</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 通知不含 <code>id</code> 字段，服务端不应对通知发送响应。违反此约定可能导致协议级错误。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"content-length-头与消息帧\">Content-Length 头与消息帧</h2><p>LSP 在 JSON-RPC 之上定义了自己的消息帧格式。每条消息由头部（Header）和内容（Content）两部分组成，以 <code>\\r\\n\\r\\n</code> 分隔。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Content-Length: 52\\r\\n&#10;\\r\\n&#10;{&quot;jsonrpc&quot;:&quot;2.0&quot;,&quot;method&quot;:&quot;initialized&quot;,&quot;params&quot;:{}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 52\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"initialized\",\"params\":{}}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>头部格式遵循 HTTP 头的约定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type HeaderField = {&#10;  name: &#39;Content-Length&#39; | &#39;Content-Type&#39;;&#10;  value: string;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HeaderField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Content-Length'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>头字段</th>\n<th>是否必须</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Content-Length</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>内容体的字节数（UTF-8）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>application/vscode-jsonrpc; charset=utf-8</code></td>\n<td>MIME 类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消息帧解析的关键步骤：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Reader as 消息读取器&#10;    participant Parser as 帧解析器&#10;    participant Handler as 消息处理器&#10;&#10;    Reader-&gt;&gt;Parser: 读取字节流&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 查找 Content-Length 头&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 跳过 \\r\\n\\r\\n&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 读取指定字节数&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Handler: JSON.parse() → Message&#10;    Handler-&gt;&gt;Handler: 根据 id 分发请求/通知\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Reader as 消息读取器\n    participant Parser as 帧解析器\n    participant Handler as 消息处理器\n\n    Reader-&gt;&gt;Parser: 读取字节流\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 查找 Content-Length 头\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 跳过 \\r\\n\\r\\n\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 读取指定字节数\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Handler: JSON.parse() → Message\n    Handler-&gt;&gt;Handler: 根据 id 分发请求/通知</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Content-Length 以字节为单位而非字符数。对于包含非 ASCII 字符的 JSON，UTF-8 编码后的字节数可能大于字符数。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"传输通道\">传输通道</h2><p>LSP 不绑定特定的传输层，支持多种通道实现。不同场景下的最优选择各不相同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"stdin-stdout-传输\">stdin/stdout 传输</h3><p>最常见的传输方式，编辑器通过子进程的标准输入/输出与语言服务器通信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createConnection, ProposedFeatures } from &#39;vscode-languageserver/node&#39;;&#10;&#10;const connection = createConnection(ProposedFeatures.all);&#10;&#10;connection.onInitialize((params) =&gt; {&#10;  return {&#10;    capabilities: {&#10;      textDocumentSync: 1,&#10;      completionProvider: { resolveProvider: true },&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;});&#10;&#10;connection.listen();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createConnection, ProposedFeatures } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vscode-languageserver/node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> connection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ProposedFeatures.all);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onInitialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    capabilities: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      textDocumentSync: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      completionProvider: { resolveProvider: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tcp-socket-传输\">TCP/Socket 传输</h3><p>适用于远程开发场景或需要多个客户端连接同一语言服务器的情况。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import * as net from &#39;node:net&#39;;&#10;&#10;const server = net.createServer((socket) =&gt; {&#10;  const connection = createConnection(() =&gt; socket, socket);&#10;  connection.listen();&#10;});&#10;&#10;server.listen(7000, &#39;127.0.0.1&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:net'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">socket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> connection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> socket, socket);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'127.0.0.1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"websocket-传输\">WebSocket 传输</h3><p>用于浏览器环境的语言服务器（如 Monaco Editor、vscode.dev）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;import { WebSocketMessageReader, WebSocketMessageWriter } from &#39;vscode-ws-jsonrpc&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 3000 });&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws) =&gt; {&#10;  const reader = new WebSocketMessageReader(ws);&#10;  const writer = new WebSocketMessageWriter(ws);&#10;  const connection = createConnection(reader, writer);&#10;  connection.listen();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { WebSocketServer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ws'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { WebSocketMessageReader, WebSocketMessageWriter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vscode-ws-jsonrpc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebSocketServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ port: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wss.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'connection'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebSocketMessageReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> writer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebSocketMessageWriter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> connection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reader, writer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各传输通道对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传输方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>多客户端</th>\n<th>远程支持</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>stdin/stdout</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>本地编辑器集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP/Socket</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>远程开发、共享服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>浏览器 IDE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Named Pipe</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Windows 本地通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"消息批处理\">消息批处理</h2><p>JSON-RPC 2.0 支持批量请求，多个请求可以打包在一个 JSON 数组中发送。但 LSP 规范中<strong>不推荐</strong>使用批处理，主流实现也不支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"[&#10;  { &quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;method&quot;: &quot;textDocument/completion&quot;, &quot;params&quot;: {} },&#10;  { &quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: 2, &quot;method&quot;: &quot;textDocument/hover&quot;, &quot;params&quot;: {} }&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"jsonrpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"textDocument/completion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {} },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"jsonrpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"textDocument/hover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {} }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 常规模式&#10;        R1[请求 1] --&gt; S[服务器]&#10;        S --&gt; RESP1[响应 1]&#10;        R2[请求 2] --&gt; S&#10;        S --&gt; RESP2[响应 2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 批处理模式&#10;        BATCH[[请求1, 请求2]&quot;] --&gt; S2[服务器]&#10;        S2 --&gt; BRESP[[响应1, 响应2]&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 常规模式\n        R1[请求 1] --&gt; S[服务器]\n        S --&gt; RESP1[响应 1]\n        R2[请求 2] --&gt; S\n        S --&gt; RESP2[响应 2]\n    end\n    subgraph 批处理模式\n        BATCH[[请求1, 请求2]\"] --&gt; S2[服务器]\n        S2 --&gt; BRESP[[响应1, 响应2]\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>常规模式</th>\n<th>批处理模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求取消</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>部分取消语义不明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序保证</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>响应顺序不保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误隔离</td>\n<td>单请求失败</td>\n<td>可能影响批内其他请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现难度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>需处理部分成功/部分失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><p>JSON-RPC 定义了标准错误码，LSP 在此基础上扩展了语言服务专用错误码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ResponseErro